# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal development docs (HIDDEN from public repo, see git history)
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Strategic intent and design rationale belong in a private repo.
# These are gitignored but still in git history (recoverable via
# `git checkout <commit> -- <path>`).
docs/STRATEGY.md
# Version ROADMAPs are local planning documents, not shipped artifacts.
# The pattern must cover two-digit minor versions (v0.11, v0.12) as well as
# single-digit ones; the previous rules matched only v0.[0-9] and v0.[0-9].[0-9]*,
# so v0.11-ROADMAP.md and v0.12-ROADMAP.md showed up as untracked and were one
# `git add -A` away from being committed.
docs/v0.*-ROADMAP.md
